      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0088_rival_03",
      "hash64": "586594CA2580F0F2",
      "text": "既然都选好宝可梦了，\\n那我们就要赶紧来场对战啦！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0088_rival_04",
      "hash64": "58658FCA2580E873",
      "text": "我会在下面的海滩等你的。\\n等你做好准备就快来找我吧！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0088_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "84EF37F70151DCA7",
      "text": "妮莫同学实在是太喜欢\\n宝可梦对战了。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "common_0088_head_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "84EF34F70151D78E",
      "text": "就当是为了加深与宝可梦之间的牵绊，\\n也请务必和她比试一下。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
